{"reviewId": "393022807_83POyIewI", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "在2025年的今天，中国城镇化率保底也有75%左右，那么由城镇化引起的工业化进程是不是也就告一段落了。\n如果说以房地产为代表的中国工业化进程要告一段落甚至衰败，那么下一个是什么？\n25年中国的机器人产业看着似乎在蓬勃发展，似乎有引领全球的势头，机器人产业是否成为新的经济引擎？时间在哪在多久？\n另外不止机器人，目前的AI产业如火如荼，包括中国在内的很多领头企业都在做AI相关转型，那么AI转化为生产力需要多久，时间又在哪？", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "虽然技术创新很重要，但对工业化起飞的触动因素来讲，技术创新并非唯一的推动因素。我们的观点是，中国本轮的高速增长并不是由技术创新推动的，而是有其国际背景，而城市化所带动的中国的工业化进程也有其必然性。", "range": "4373-4472", "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "393022807_83POyIewI", "userVid": 393022807, "topics": [], "createTime": 1760228820, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 393022807, "name": "Majesty", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/aSUaVfbBYU8NFeuGdqM1yeyB18ogFYyNemos2pRia1SFsOcNpLxRAqqfH551jwcKAZnspl4gFFNK5PZQSia3j3IEDhWs1xwbkWGglXTluPK4Q/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240617-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 3130868, "name": "隔川", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/v6XbW38nFOQXvmR7akk3GKZicpWdSCqPXjYwSaiaPD4Ofibicfk2Lnicdz7ia2OllLqwHpFaibjESymE18/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "隔川", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "对一切看似知道实则不知道的事情充满好奇", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-500", "desc": "